2403:\begin{theorem}\label{distance4}
2404:Suppose the distances between vertices of degree $>3$ in a combinatorial pentagonal tiling are always $\ge 4$, then the tiling is either the earth map tiling in Figure \ref{map5}, or the earth map tiling in Figure \ref{map4}.
2405:\end{theorem}
