Rejected at Step 0 after reading the complete v6 paper.

The native tilings satisfy G and V, but fail H on both tracks:

- Track A: the relevant theorems explicitly construct or classify the tilings; no hard distribution is established.
- Track B: at the largest writable instance, both construction and any explicit answer require the same 240 vertex-incidence emissions. Compressed answers collapse to five easily guessed earth-map families.

The complete, quantified analysis is in [REJECTED.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1209.0315/REJECTED.md). Per the instructions, no generator or fabricated gate/oracle artifacts were created. The source paper is [arXiv:1209.0315](https://arxiv.org/abs/1209.0315).
